    Allow repeated broad adaptive office sessions within cumulative Economy budget
    
    Separate optional per_run_caps from cumulative 45-day caps. Guard+reserve now pessimistically precharge only each session slice, while ledger still counts full active/held liabilities and actual closed use against office and aggregate ceilings. Preserve legacy config behavior when per_run_caps omitted; negative tests prove two real shell reservations succeed after 10k observed, large overrun blocks new admission, malformed slice denied.

